{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52324","headline":"诗（幷序） 八十五 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 八十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前身有何罪，色（项、戴谓通「索」）得湼（项校「鸠」）盘荼。\n天下恶风俗，临丧命独（项校「犊」）车。\n男婚不（项校「傅」）香粉，女嫁着钗花。\n屍枥（项疑「厝」）阴地卧，知堵（项校「者」）是谁家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}